Carafe: a thread DXVK cannot create is tried again for up to retryMs, 120 s by default, before DXVK gives up.
On the Switch an application has 96 threads. At the limit DXVK threw std::system_error, which nothing catches,
and the game ended; now it waits, a little longer each time, and says so in its log every 5 s.
Zlib, as the file it changes.

